    "A backstop. Belay stops holding after this and tells you why.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dieser Zeit hält Belay deinen Mac nicht mehr wach und sagt dir Bescheid."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay stops keeping your Mac awake after this time and lets you know."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al llegar a este tiempo, Belay deja de mantener el Mac despierto y te avisa."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après ce délai, Belay cesse de garder votre Mac éveillé et vous prévient."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dopo questo intervallo, Belay smette di tenere sveglio il Mac e ti avvisa."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "После этого времени Belay разрешит Mac уснуть и сообщит об этом."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过这段时间后，Belay 会让 Mac 进入睡眠并通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder changing means work is happening. A process being alive never counts as work on its own. It only tells Belay the session has ended when it disappears.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordneraktivität zählt als Arbeit. Ein laufender Prozess zeigt Belay nur, wann die Sitzung endet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folder activity counts as work. A running process only tells Belay when the session ends."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La actividad de la carpeta cuenta como trabajo. Un proceso en ejecución solo le indica a Belay cuándo termina la sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'activité du dossier compte comme du travail. Un processus en cours indique seulement à Belay quand la session se termine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'attività della cartella conta come lavoro. Un processo in esecuzione indica a Belay solo quando termina la sessione."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Изменения в папке считаются работой. Запущенный процесс лишь помогает Belay понять, когда сессия завершилась."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件夹活动算作工作。正在运行的进程只用于告诉 Belay 会话何时结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mark that says paused": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A mark that says paused"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Zeichen für Pause"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una marca que dice pausa"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une marque qui dit pause"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un segno che dice pausa"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Значок, который говорит «пауза»"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会显示暂停的图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short note when you change mode by hand. Turning off interface sounds in System Settings silences these too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Ein kurzer Ton, wenn Sie den Modus von Hand ändern. Sind Oberflächentöne in den Systemeinstellungen aus, verstummen auch diese."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A short note when you change mode by hand. Turning off interface sounds in System Settings silences these too."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Un tono breve cuando cambias de modo a mano. Si desactivas los sonidos de la interfaz en Ajustes del Sistema, estos también callan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Une note brève quand vous changez de mode à la main. Si les sons de l'interface sont coupés dans Réglages Système, ceux-ci se taisent aussi."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Una nota breve quando cambi modo a mano. Se i suoni dell'interfaccia sono disattivati in Impostazioni di Sistema, anche questi tacciono."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Звуковое сопровождение интерфейса Belay. Если выключить звуки интерфейса в Системных настройках, эти тоже замолчат."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手动切换模式时的一声轻响。在“系统设置”中关闭界面声音后，这些声音也会静音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A timestamped backup is made first. Everything already in the file is preserved, and \"Remove\" puts it back exactly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay legt zuerst eine Sicherung mit Zeitstempel an. „Entfernen“ stellt die ursprüngliche Datei wieder her."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay makes a timestamped backup first. \"Remove\" restores the original file."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay crea primero una copia de seguridad con fecha y hora. «Quitar» restaura el archivo original."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay crée d'abord une sauvegarde horodatée. « Retirer » restaure le fichier d'origine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay crea prima una copia di sicurezza con data e ora. «Rimuovi» ripristina il file originale."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сначала Belay создаёт резервную копию с отметкой времени. «Убрать» восстановит исходный файл."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Belay 会先创建带时间戳的备份。“移除”会还原原始文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
