    },
    "How long Belay keeps holding after your agent goes quiet. Longer is safer: sleeping mid-task costs far more than staying awake a minute too long.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie lange Belay wartet, nachdem dein Agent still geworden ist, bevor dein Mac schlafen darf. Ein wenig Puffer verhindert, dass der Mac zwischen Aufgaben einschläft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long Belay waits after an agent goes quiet before letting your Mac sleep. A little extra time helps avoid sleep between tasks."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto espera Belay después de que un agente quede inactivo antes de dejar dormir el Mac. Un pequeño margen evita que se duerma entre tareas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Durée pendant laquelle Belay attend après l'arrêt d'un agent avant de laisser votre Mac se mettre en veille. Un petit délai évite la veille entre deux tâches."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per quanto Belay aspetta dopo che un agente si ferma prima di lasciare andare il Mac in stop. Un piccolo margine evita lo stop tra un'attività e l'altra."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сколько Belay ждёт после того, как агент затих, прежде чем разрешить Mac уснуть. Небольшой запас помогает не уснуть между задачами."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体停止活动后，Belay 在让 Mac 进入睡眠前等待的时间。稍长一些有助于避免在任务之间进入睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
